<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p>I am pleased to announce that our
Sickle Cell Initiative Amazon promotion is still active and will run through
June 30, 2024. This promotion is part of our ongoing commitment to support the
sickle cell community and raise awareness about this important cause.</p><p><br></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Your commitment to hosting sickle cell
blood drives has been instrumental in helping us reach our goals, and we look
forward to working with you to host more blood drives in the future.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Together, we can make a difference in
the lives of those affected by sickle cell disease. Thank you very much for
your partnership and support.</span></p><p><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:105%"><b><i>&lt;&lt;PROMOTION&gt;&gt; As a special thank
you, every time you host a Red Cross blood drive between July 1, 2023 and June
30, 2024 the donors that come to give blood, will </i></b><b><i>receive a $20 Amazon.com Gift
Card* by email, all courtesy of our partners at Amazon.**</i></b></p><p class="MsoNormal">Let’s
schedule your lifesaving blood drive, contact me today. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background: yellow;">&lt;AM Name&gt;</span></p><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1"></span><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">*Restrictions apply, see
amazon.com/gc-legal</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline;user-select: text;
-webkit-user-drag: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;overflow-wrap: break-word;
font-kerning: none"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">**Presenting
donors who receive this offer&nbsp;<u>and</u>&nbsp;present to donate during the
applicable promotional time frame are eligible to receive the&nbsp;above
described&nbsp;e-gift card(s). This offer is non-transferable and not
redeemable for cash. Limit one (1) per presenting donor unless otherwise&nbsp;indicated.
[If a presenting donor qualifies for multiple offers, the donor will receive
all offers unless otherwise indicated.] Instructions on how to&nbsp;redeem your
gift card will be emailed to the address listed in the presenting donor’s
American Red Cross donor profile approximately thirty (30) days after attempted
donation(s). All gift cards are subject to individual merchant terms and
conditions, and all trademarks are property of their respective owners.
Merchants and offers are subject to change.&nbsp; No substitutions by
presenting donors. American Red Cross is not responsible for lost, damaged,
corrupted or stolen gift cards and may replace any such cards at its sole
discretion. Any questions or problems in connection with redeeming gift cards
must be directed to the merchant.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><br></p>]]></td>
